00:10:21,107 --> 00:10:24,447
それよりも…歌がいいな～。
Ooorrr... I'll trade you for a song~

152
00:10:25,127 --> 00:10:25,587
はい？
Huh?

153
00:10:25,787 --> 00:10:34,367
だって！アニャさん最近ずっと怖い顔してますよ。たまには息抜きしないと。私と1曲歌ってくれたら、絵は差し上げます。どうですか？
Come on! You've been so serious lately. You gotta get loose sometimes. So one song with me, and you get to keep the picture. That's the deal!

154
00:10:34,827 --> 00:10:37,387
そこまで言うなら…歌ってやるか！
If that's what you want, then alright!

155
00:10:48,362 --> 00:10:51,342
大きい白いキャンバスに 虚構のコラージュを貼るよ
On a big white canvas, I paste a collage of fiction

156
00:10:51,602 --> 00:10:56,122
どこからでもキレイに映る 誇張された天使が居たよ
There was an exaggerated angel that looked stunning from every angle

157
00:11:09,102 --> 00:11:13,242
薔薇人歪んだ正しくなくても見えた
A rose, a person distorted, even if they weren't right I could still see them

158
00:11:13,362 --> 00:11:18,042
生きるため立ち寄った美術館のセザンヌに
In the Cézanne at the art museum I stopped by to stay alive

159
00:11:18,922 --> 00:11:23,262
なにもわからないな まだ知らずにいても描けた
I don't understand anything, but even without knowing I managed to paint

160
00:11:23,382 --> 00:11:27,202
赤ざっと塗り込んだ バカ きっとそうだった
I kept plastering red all over — idiot, I surely did

161
00:11:27,202 --> 00:11:30,362
ヒドい筆の絵画 だけどそこがいいな
A painting with terrible brushwork, but that's what's good about it

162
00:11:34,262 --> 00:11:37,362
くぐらない線だな そのまま
Such meaningless lines, just as they are

163
00:11:37,522 --> 00:11:38,262
ああ
Ah

164
00:11:40,882 --> 00:11:42,302
切って貼った皮
The skin that's cut and pasted

165
00:11:42,302 --> 00:11:44,322
裂けて見えた痣
The bruises seen when it's torn

166
00:11:44,322 --> 00:11:45,642
ララ ラン ラララ
La la lan lalala

167
00:11:46,062 --> 00:11:48,582
笑うように浮いた アバラ
Floating ribs that seem to laugh

168
00:11:50,082 --> 00:11:52,082
ぎゅって抱いた空
I held the emptiness tight

169
00:11:52,082 --> 00:11:54,522
だって泣いたから
Because I had cried

170
00:11:57,402 --> 00:12:02,602
ララ ラン ラララ なげく壁に 描いたパブロ・ピカソ
La la lan lalala, painted on the grieving wall — Pablo Picasso

171
00:12:00,302 --> 00:12:03,322
なぜか私のことだなって眺めちゃんたよ
Somehow I found myself thinking 'this is about me', as I gazed

172
00:12:03,422 --> 00:12:05,182
これが欲しいなって感じたら
It made me feel 'I want this'

173
00:12:05,382 --> 00:12:07,522
セザンヌの絵をキボヌン なんてね
I want a Cézanne painting, just kidding

174
00:12:07,922 --> 00:12:11,062
老人がとなりでじっと見てたよ
An old man beside me was staring

175
00:12:11,162 --> 00:12:13,102
欺瞞ウソ若さならば
Deception and lies — if it's youth

176
00:12:13,262 --> 00:12:16,142
本物の意味あるのかな
I wonder if there's any meaning to the real thing

177
00:12:16,302 --> 00:12:20,602
真実抱いたまま 腐り落ちて床で死んでた
Whilst holding the truth in your arms, it rotted away and died on the floor

178
00:12:20,942 --> 00:12:25,622
赤ざっと塗り込んだ やっぱずっと良かった
I kept plastering red all over — that was the best after all

179
00:12:25,782 --> 00:12:30,102
イヤらしい線だな 今もう
Such nasty lines, even now, ah

180
00:12:30,322 --> 00:12:31,082
ああ
Ah

181
00:12:42,882 --> 00:12:44,322
切って貼った皮
The skin that's cut and pasted

182
00:12:44,502 --> 00:12:46,462
咲いて散った花
The flowers bloomed and scattered

183
00:12:46,462 --> 00:12:47,782
ララ ラン ラララ
La la lan lalala

184
00:12:48,182 --> 00:12:51,162
笑うように見えた カラダ
A body that seemed to laugh

185
00:12:53,062 --> 00:12:55,042
ぎゅって抱いた空
I held the emptiness tight

186
